---
/* The admin stylesheet, brought in through a component so that it is bundled AFTER the site's global stylesheet.
   A bare `import '../../styles/admin.css'` is hoisted above every other import by the Astro compiler, and the build
   orders a page's stylesheets by import position, so on the live site admin.css came first and lost every tie to
   profile.css (the sign-in page's Show password box took the text field's full-width border, L-40). A component
   import keeps its place in the frontmatter: every admin page imports this after its layout, so the admin rules sit
   last, as they do in development. The component draws nothing. */
import '../../styles/admin.css';
---
